WEBVTT

NOTE dashboard-overview: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

V0-1
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:05.760
The whole feature lives on one
screen. Here are its four regions.

V1-1
00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.931
Start at the toolbar. It shows
your site name, the weather strip,

V1-2
00:00:16.031 --> 00:00:19.130
and the average, high, and
low moisture for the course.

V2a-1
00:00:23.786 --> 00:00:27.073
On the map, stations scanned
today are filled with a color.

V2a-2
00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:29.736
Stations from an earlier
scan are drawn clear.

V2b-1
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:35.246
The legend gives four bands,
from 0 to 5 percent up to above 30.

V2b-2
00:00:35.346 --> 00:00:40.650
Each station takes its band's color,
so you can see which stations are dry.

V2c-1
00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:45.640
These bands are only the starting point.
The band boundaries are yours to change.

V2d-1
00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:50.190
Drag a handle, then let go,
and the map recolors.

V2e-1
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.013
This button switches to variance,

V2e-2
00:00:53.113 --> 00:00:55.940
which shows how far each
station is from its target.

V3a-1
00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:09.650
This list picks the areas, holes,
or stations the chart plots.

V3b-1
00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:13.436
The header shows your selection
and its average moisture.

V4a-1
00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:22.810
The table is a drill-down. It starts at
the course, with a row for each area.

V4b-1
00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:25.273
Click an area to see its holes.

V4c-1
00:01:26.283 --> 00:01:27.993
Click a hole to see its stations.

V4d-1
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.120
Click a station's row,
and the chart header follows.

V4d2-1
00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.910
The check box is separate.
It picks stations for a bulk change.

V4e-1
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:40.873
Three columns are yours
to edit: Target VWC,

V4e-2
00:01:40.973 --> 00:01:44.066
the percent adjustment,
and the Enable switch.

V4f-1
00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:48.343
You can't edit Current
or Suggested adjustment.

V4g-1
00:01:49.316 --> 00:01:51.396
To go back up, click a name in the trail.

V5a-1
00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:59.930
Before you leave, read the
number on Push Changes.

V5a-2
00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.966
That is how many changes are pending.

V5b-1
00:02:03.116 --> 00:02:06.096
The green counter beside it
shows how many went out today.
